This product is a Swift reimplementation — NOT a fork — of the following GPL-3.0
Python project, whose interface logic and MeshCore wire format it ports:

  RNS_Over_Meshcore — comms-engineer
  https://github.com/comms-engineer/RNS_Over_Meshcore

RNS_Over_Meshcore was itself forked from:

  RNS_Over_Meshtastic — landandair
  https://github.com/landandair/RNS_Over_Meshtastic

It speaks the companion protocol of, and credits:

  MeshCore — ripplebiz and contributors (LoRa-mesh firmware + companion protocol)
  https://github.com/meshcore-dev/MeshCore
  meshcore_py (companion library the frame codec follows)
  https://github.com/meshcore-dev/meshcore_py

  Meshtastic — the upstream inspiration for the original Meshtastic tunnel
  https://github.com/meshtastic

It plugs into, and depends on (but does not modify), the permissively-licensed:

  ReticulumSwift — a Swift port of the Reticulum Network Stack
  https://github.com/SullivanPrell/ReticulumSwift
  Reticulum — Mark Qvist
  https://github.com/markqvist/Reticulum

